     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I&#39;ll take a guess that the problem is here:<div><br></div><div>Accidents0513$Date==(input$SelectedDate)<br></div><div><br></div><div>What is class(Accidents0513)? If it&#39;s string, then perhaps</div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-family:&#39;helvetica neue&#39;,helvetica,arial,sans-serif\">Accidents0513$Date==as.character(input$SelectedDate)</span><br></div><div><span style=\"font-family:&#39;helvetica neue&#39;,helvetica,arial,sans-serif\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:&#39;helvetica neue&#39;,helvetica,arial,sans-serif\">would help.</span></div></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\">On Mon, May 9, 2016 at 8:29 AM MS Gillani &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">786m...@gmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><br>Hi All,<div><br></div><div><p style=\"margin-bottom:1em;font-size:15px;clear:both;color:rgb(36,39,41);font-family:Arial,&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,sans-serif\">I need to create a shiny app that reacts whenever the dateInput is changed. </p><p style=\"margin-bottom:1em;font-size:15px;clear:both;color:rgb(36,39,41);font-family:Arial,&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,sans-serif\">A change in the dateInput should  filter the data based on that date and then it should update the results in the leaflet map/plot. </p><p style=\"margin-bottom:1em;font-size:15px;clear:both;color:rgb(36,39,41);font-family:Arial,&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">I&#39;m not getting something right. is it the dateInput that is the issue please? </span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:1em;clear:both\"><font color=\"#242729\" face=\"Arial, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, sans-serif\">The map is blank, but when I hard code the date in the filter to a date like &quot;01/01/2005&quot; and take it out of a reactive function I don&#39;t get any problems. Please can someone help as I&#39;m actually new to shiny and programming, so please go easy on me. I&#39;ve tried on one other forum but get many responses. I don&#39;t mind if the action button has to go. Thanks for reading</font><br></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:1em;font-size:15px;clear:both;color:rgb(36,39,41);font-family:Arial,&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,sans-serif\">Here is the code I&#39;m using:</p></div><div><pre style=\"margin-bottom:1em;padding:5px;width:auto;max-height:600px;overflow:auto;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;background-color:rgb(239,240,241);color:rgb(57,51,24);word-wrap:normal\"><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54);white-space:inherit\">ui.R</span><br></pre><pre style=\"margin-bottom:1em;padding:5px;width:auto;max-height:600px;overflow:auto;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;background-color:rgb(239,240,241);color:rgb(57,51,24);word-wrap:normal\"><code style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">library</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">shiny</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">\r\nlibrary</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">leaflet</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">\r\n\r\nshinyUI</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">fluidPage</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">\r\n     titlePanel </span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">title </span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(125,39,39)\">&quot;Accidents Map of the UK&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">),</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">\r\n     sidebarLayout</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">\r\n            sidebarPanel</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> h3</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(125,39,39)\">&quot;Please select a date below&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">),</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">\r\n                         dateInput</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(125,39,39)\">&#39;SelectedDate&#39;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> label </span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(125,39,39)\">&#39;Accident Date&#39;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">    value </span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(125,39,39)\">&quot;2005-01-04&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> min </span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(125,39,39)\">&quot;2004-12-31&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> max </span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(125,39,39)\">&quot;2014-01-01&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> format </span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(125,39,39)\">&quot;dd/mm/yyyy&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> startview </span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(125,39,39)\">&quot;month&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> weekstart </span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(125,39,39)\">0</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> language </span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(125,39,39)\">&quot;en&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> width </span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(125,39,39)\">NULL</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">),</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">actionButton</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(125,39,39)\">&quot;UpdateButton&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(125,39,39)\">&quot;Update Now&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">)),</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">\r\n\r\nmainPanel</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">((</span><span style=\"color:rgb(125,39,39)\">&quot;Accidents&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">\r\n\r\n          leafletOutput</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(125,39,39)\">&quot;mymap&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">))))</span></code></pre><pre style=\"margin-bottom:1em;padding:5px;width:auto;max-height:600px;overflow:auto;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;background-color:rgb(239,240,241);color:rgb(57,51,24);word-wrap:normal\"><code style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">server.R</span></code></pre><pre style=\"margin-bottom:1em;padding:5px;width:auto;max-height:600px;overflow:auto;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;background-color:rgb(239,240,241);color:rgb(57,51,24);word-wrap:normal\"><code style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">library(shiny)\r\nlibrary(sqldf)\r\nlibrary(dplyr)\r\n\r\nshinyServer(<span style=\"color:rgb(16,16,148)\">function</span>(input, output, session) {\r\n\r\n    FilteredDates  &lt;- eventReactive(input$UpdateButton,{filter(Accidents0513, Accidents0513$Date==(input$SelectedDate))})\r\n\r\noutput$mymap &lt;- renderLeaflet({\r\n\r\nleaflet() %&gt;%\r\n\r\n  addProviderTiles(<span style=\"color:rgb(125,39,39)\">&quot;MapQuestOpen.OSM&quot;</span>,\r\n                   options = providerTileOptions(noWrap = <span style=\"color:rgb(125,39,39)\">TRUE</span>)\r\n  ) %&gt;%\r\n\r\n  addCircleMarkers(radius = <span style=\"color:rgb(125,39,39)\">5</span>,\r\n                   clusterOptions = markerClusterOptions(),data = FilteredDates())\r\n})})</span></code></pre></div></div>\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;Shiny - Web Framework for R&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">shiny-discus...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nTo view this discussion on the web visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/shiny-discuss/f8c1a02e-9b10-4ca9-befa-8c28092ba769%40googlegroups.com?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=footer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/shiny-discuss/f8c1a02e-9b10-4ca9-befa-8c28092ba769%2540googlegroups.com?utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_source%3Dfooter&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792393658934000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1SAyIG0PPOe7DXf0TF4Scb\">https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/shiny-discuss/f8c1a02e-9b10-4ca9-befa-8c28092ba769%40googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nFor more options, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/optout\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/optout&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792393658934000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0tsqhGub_uZghTq8JoTbmg\">https://groups.google.com/d/optout</a>.<br>\r\n</blockquote></div>\r\n"
